# Optional settings. Copy to a real environment (set in CMD) - this application does NOT
# read .env files automatically. Never commit real secrets.
#
# CMD examples (current window only):
#   set TQI_ENV=development
#   set TQI_PORT=5000
#
# TQI_ENV            development (default) | production
# TQI_SECRET_KEY     required when TQI_ENV=production. In development a random key is
#                    generated once and stored in instance\.secret_key (git-ignored).
# TQI_DATABASE_PATH  optional path to the SQLite file (default: instance\textile_quality.db)
# TQI_DEBUG          set to 1 to enable Flask debug mode (development only, local use only)
# TQI_PORT           local port for "python run.py" (default 5000)
# TQI_LOG_LEVEL      INFO (default), DEBUG, WARNING, ERROR
